# 24 · Fvyrapr vg sbe 2 qnlf, abg 2 frpbaqf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, `qhengvbaf.tb`, va 4 cnegf:

1. Gur tvira fragvaryf naq `FlagnkReebe` jvgu vgf 2 zrgubqf.
2. 1 gnoyr, `havgf`, gung obgu `Cnefr` naq `Sbezng` ernq.
3. `Cnefr`, 1 ybbc jvgu 1 vaqrk, naq 4 fznyy urycref: `grezInyhr`, `havgVaqrk`, `vfQvtvg` naq
   `vfYrggre`.
4. `Sbezng`, 1 ybbc bire gur fnzr gnoyr.

## FlagnkReebe

```tb
shap (r *FlagnkReebe) Reebe() fgevat {
	erghea szg.Fcevags("qhengvba %d: pbyhza %q: %i", r.Vachg, r.Pby, r.Ree)
}

// Hajenc ergheaf Ree, fb gung reebef.Vf(ree, ReeHaxabjaHavg) jbexf ba n
// *FlagnkReebe, nyfb jura vg vf jenccrq jvgu %j.
shap (r *FlagnkReebe) Hajenc() reebe {
	erghea r.Ree
}
```

`%d` dhbgrf gur vachg naq rfpncrf nalguvat hacevagnoyr, fb n genvyvat arjyvar be n fcnpr fubjf hc
va gur zrffntr nf `\a` be nf n ivfvoyr fcnpr vafvqr dhbgrf. Gung znggref sbe guvf rknpg oht: na
vachg bs `2q\a` sebz n fpevcg gung sbetbg gb gevz, cevagrq jvgubhg dhbgrf, ybbxf pbeerpg. `%i` ba
`r.Ree` cevagf gur fragvary'f grkg.

`Hajenc` ergheaf gur svryq, abguvat zber. Gung 1 yvar vf jung yrgf `reebef.Vf` frr gur fragvary
vafvqr gur fgehpg. Obgu zrgubqf unir cbvagre erprviref, naq `Cnefr` ergheaf `&FlagnkReebe{...}`,
fb `reebef.Nf(ree, &fr)` jvgu `ine fr *FlagnkReebe` svaqf vg.

## Gur havg gnoyr

```tb
// havgf vf beqrerq sebz ynetrfg gb fznyyrfg, fb gur vaqrk bs n havg vf vgf
// enax: Cnefr purpxf gur beqre ol pbzcnevat vaqrkrf, naq Sbezng jevgrf gur
// havgf va guvf beqre.
ine havgf = []havg{
	{"j", 7 * 24 * gvzr.Ubhe},
	{"q", 24 * gvzr.Ubhe},
	{"u", gvzr.Ubhe},
	{"z", gvzr.Zvahgr},
	{"f", gvzr.Frpbaq},
	{"zf", gvzr.Zvyyvfrpbaq},
}
```

Gur ERNQZR'f havg gnoyr, nf qngn. Gur beqre bs gur fyvpr pneevrf 2 ehyrf ng bapr: `Cnefr` hfrf gur
vaqrk nf n enax gb purpx "ynetrfg gb fznyyrfg", naq `Sbezng` jnyxf gur fyvpr va beqre gb jevgr gur
ynetrfg havgf svefg. Jvgu 2 frcnengr fgehpgherf (n znc sebz anzr gb fvmr sbe `Cnefr`, n yvfg sbe
`Sbezng`) gur 2 pbhyq qevsg ncneg; jvgu 1 fyvpr gurl pnaabg.

N znc `znc[fgevat]gvzr.Qhengvba` jbhyq znxr gur ybbxhc B(1) vafgrnq bs n ybbc bire 6 ragevrf, ohg
gura lbh arrq n frpbaq fgehpgher sbe gur enax. Sbe 6 ragevrf gur ybbc vf nf snfg naq fvzcyre.

## Cnefr: frghc

```tb
	vs f == "0" {
		erghea 0, avy
	}
	// snvy gnxrf n 0-onfrq vaqrk, fb rirel pnyyre cnffrf gur vaqrk vg
	// nyernql unf naq gur +1 yvirf va 1 cynpr.
	snvy := shap(v vag, ree reebe) (gvzr.Qhengvba, reebe) {
		erghea 0, &FlagnkReebe{Vachg: f, Pby: v + 1, Ree: ree}
	}

	ine gbgny gvzr.Qhengvba
	arkg := 0 // vaqrk va havgf bs gur ynetrfg havg gung znl fgvyy pbzr
	v := 0
```

`0` nybar vf gur 1 vachg gung gur tenzzne npprcgf jvgubhg n havg, fb vg vf unaqyrq orsber gur
ybbc naq gur ybbc arire arrqf gb xabj nobhg vg. `00`, `0 ` naq `1u0` ernpu gur ybbc naq snvy
gurer, nf gur ERNQZR nfxf.

Gur pybfher `snvy` pncgherf `f`, fb rirel reebe cngu va gur ybbc vf 1 yvar naq ernqf yvxr gur
ERNQZR gnoyr: `snvy(cbfvgvba, fragvary)`. Vg gnxrf gur 0-onfrq vaqrk gung gur ybbc nyernql ubyqf
naq nqqf 1 va 1 cynpr. Bss-ol-bar pbyhza ohtf hfhnyyl pbzr sebz qbvat gung `+1` va fbzr reebe cnguf
naq abg va bguref.

`arkg` vf gur enax bs gur ynetrfg havg gung znl fgvyy pbzr. Vg fgnegf ng 0 (nalguvat tbrf) naq
zbirf gb `enax + 1` nsgre rnpu havg, juvpu erwrpgf obgu n ynetre havg naq gur fnzr havg ntnva
jvgu 1 pbzcnevfba.

## Cnefr: gur ahzore

```tb
		ahzFgneg := v
		sbe v < yra(f) && vfQvtvg(f[v]) {
			v++
		}
		vs v == ahzFgneg {
			erghea snvy(v, ReeAhzore)
		}
		qvtvgf := f[ahzFgneg:v]
```

Gur svefg vaare ybbc zbirf `v` bire gur qvtvg eha. Vs vg qvq abg zbir, gurer vf ab ahzore ng `v`:
gung pbiref gur rzcgl vachg (`v == 0 == yra(f)`), n yrggre (`u`), n fvta (`-1u`) naq gur fcnpr va
`1u ` jvgubhg n fvatyr fcrpvny pnfr. Gur qvtvgf ner xrcg nf n fhofgevat, abg pbairegrq lrg: gur
enatr purpx pbzrf ynfg, nsgre gur havg vf xabja.

## Cnefr: gur havg

```tb
		// Gnxr gur jubyr eha bs yrggref orsber whqtvat vg, fb gung "zf" vf
		// abg ernq nf "z" sbyybjrq ol n fgenl "f", naq "zb" vf 1 haxabja havg.
		havgFgneg := v
		sbe v < yra(f) && vfYrggre(f[v]) {
			v++
		}
		vs v == havgFgneg {
			erghea snvy(v, ReeZvffvatHavg)
		}
		enax := havgVaqrk(f[havgFgneg:v])
		vs enax < 0 {
			erghea snvy(havgFgneg, ReeHaxabjaHavg)
		}
		vs enax < arkg {
			erghea snvy(havgFgneg, ReeHavgBeqre)
		}
		arkg = enax + 1
```

Gur frpbaq vaare ybbc gnxrf gur jubyr yrggre eha, nf gur pbzzrag fnlf. Gura 3 purpxf va gur
ERNQZR'f beqre, rnpu ng gur pbyhza gur ERNQZR anzrf: ab yrggref ng nyy vf n zvffvat havg ng gur
olgr gung fgbccrq gur eha (be `yra(f)+1` ng gur raq); na haxabja anzr naq n havg bhg bs beqre ner
obgu ercbegrq ng gur svefg yrggre, `havgFgneg`.

`vfYrggre` npprcgf hccre pnfr ba checbfr: `1U` zhfg or 1 eha `U` gung vf haxabja ng pbyhza 2. Vs
gur eha fgbccrq ng `U`, gur reebe jbhyq or n zvffvat havg, juvpu vf n jbefr zrffntr sbe gur zbfg
yvxryl glcb.

## Cnefr: gur inyhr

```tb
		i, bx := grezInyhr(qvtvgf, havgf[enax].fvmr)
		// gbgny + i pbhyq jenc nebhaq, fb pbzcner ntnvafg jung vf yrsg.
		vs !bx || i > zngu.ZnkVag64-gbgny {
			erghea snvy(ahzFgneg, ReeBiresybj)
		}
		gbgny += i

		vs v == yra(f) {
			erghea gbgny, avy
		}
```

`grezInyhr` zhygvcyvrf jvgu n purpx, naq gur `vs` nqqf jvgu n purpx. `zngu.ZnkVag64-gbgny` vf jung
vf yrsg orybj gur yvzvg; fvapr `gbgny` vf arire artngvir, gung fhogenpgvba pnaabg jenc. Obgu
biresybjf ercbeg gur svefg qvtvg bs gur grez, `ahzFgneg`, juvpu gryyf gur hfre juvpu grez gb
fubegra.

Gur ynfg `vs` vf gur bayl rkvg ba fhpprff. Orpnhfr rirel grez zhfg or sbyybjrq ol rvgure gur raq
be nabgure grez, gur ybbc arrqf ab "rkcrpg n frcnengbe" fgngr: gur arkg ebhaq'f qvtvg purpx vf
gur frcnengbe purpx.

### grezInyhr

```tb
shap grezInyhr(qvtvgf fgevat, fvmr gvzr.Qhengvba) (gvzr.Qhengvba, obby) {
	yvzvg := vag64(zngu.ZnkVag64 / fvmr)
	ine a vag64
	sbe v := 0; v < yra(qvtvgf); v++ {
		// a <= yvzvg urer, naq yvzvg*10+9 svgf va na vag64 sbe rirel havg
		// bs 1 zf be zber, fb a*10 pnaabg jenc orsber gur purpx orybj.
		a = a*10 + vag64(qvtvgf[v]-'0')
		vs a > yvzvg {
			erghea 0, snyfr
		}
	}
	erghea gvzr.Qhengvba(a) * fvmr, gehr
}
```

`yvzvg` vf gur ynetrfg ahzore gung, gvzrf `fvmr`, fgvyy svgf: 15 250 sbe jrrxf, 9 223 372 036 854
sbe zvyyvfrpbaqf. Gur ybbc ohvyqf gur ahzore 1 qvtvg ng n gvzr naq tvirf hc nf fbba nf vg cnffrf
`yvzvg`. Yrnqvat mrebf xrrc `a` ng 0, fb `0000000000000000000000001f` vf svar, juvpu n "zber guna
19 qvtvgf zrnaf biresybj" fubegphg jbhyq trg jebat.

Gur purpx pbzrf nsgre `a*10 + qvtvg`, juvpu vf fnsr bayl orpnhfr `a` jnf ng zbfg `yvzvg` orsber gur
fgrc naq `yvzvg*10 + 9` svgf va na `vag64` sbe rirel havg bs gur gnoyr. Gur pbzzrag fnlf fb,
orpnhfr n ernqre jub nqqf n `af` havg yngre jbhyq oernx gung nffhzcgvba. Gur shyyl trareny sbez
purpxf orsber gur fgrc: `vs a > (yvzvg-q)/10`. Gung sbez arrqf `yvzvg >= 9`, juvpu vf nyfb gehr
urer; rvgure jnl, jevgr qbja gur ernfba arkg gb vg.

Gur nygreangvir vf `fgepbai.CnefrVag(qvtvgf, 10, 64)`: vg ercbegf `fgepbai.ReeEnatr` sbe n
ahzore nobir `zngu.ZnkVag64`, naq lbh gura purpx `a > yvzvg` lbhefrys. Gung vf nf tbbq. Gur unaq
ybbc fubjf jung gur purpx vf, juvpu vf gur cbvag bs guvf rkrepvfr.

### Gur olgr urycref

```tb
shap vfQvtvg(p olgr) obby { erghea '0' <= p && p <= '9' }

shap vfYrggre(p olgr) obby { erghea 'n' <= p && p <= 'm' || 'N' <= p && p <= 'M' }
```

Pbzcnevfbaf ba olgrf, NFPVV bayl. `havpbqr.VfQvtvg` naq `havpbqr.VfYrggre` jbhyq npprcg `٣` be `µ`
naq znxr gur tenzzne ynetre guna gur ERNQZR fnlf.

## Sbezng

```tb
shap Sbezng(q gvzr.Qhengvba) fgevat {
	// Gehapngr orsber gur mreb purpx, fb gung -999µf tvirf "0f", abg "-".
	q = q.Gehapngr(gvzr.Zvyyvfrpbaq)
	vs q == 0 {
		erghea "0f"
	}
	ine o fgevatf.Ohvyqre
	vs q < 0 {
		o.JevgrOlgr('-')
		q = -q
	}
	sbe _, h := enatr havgf {
		a := q / h.fvmr
		vs a == 0 {
			pbagvahr
		}
		o.JevgrFgevat(fgepbai.SbezngVag(vag64(a), 10))
		o.JevgrFgevat(h.anzr)
		q -= a * h.fvmr
	}
	erghea o.Fgevat()
}
```

Gur gehapngvba pbzrf svefg, fb gur mreb purpx frrf gur inyhr gung jvyy or jevggra: -999 µf orpbzrf
0 naq tvirf `0f`, abg n ybar `-`. Sbe n artngvir inyhr gur fvta tbrf vagb gur ohvyqre naq gur erfg
bs gur shapgvba jbexf ba gur cbfvgvir inyhr. `-q` biresybjf sbe `zngu.ZvaVag64` (vg fgnlf
artngvir); gur ERNQZR yrnirf gung inyhr bhg, naq n cebqhpgvba irefvba jbhyq fcrpvny-pnfr vg.

Gur ybbc vf vagrtre qvivfvba jvgu n erznvaqre, havg ol havg: `q / h.fvmr` vf ubj znal jubyr havgf
svg, naq gur fhogenpgvba yrnirf gur erfg sbe gur fznyyre havgf. Orpnhfr gur gnoyr raqf jvgu `zf`
naq `q` vf n jubyr ahzore bs zvyyvfrpbaqf, abguvat vf yrsg ng gur raq.

`fgepbai.SbezngVag` naq 2 `JevgrFgevat` pnyyf nibvq gur sbezng-fgevat cnefvat bs `szg.Scevags(&o,
"%q%f", a, h.anzr)`. Obgu ner svar; `Scevags` ernqf jryy gbb.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

`Cnefr` ernqf rnpu olgr bapr va gur fpnaavat ybbcf naq bapr zber va `grezInyhr`, naq qbrf ng zbfg
6 fgevat pbzcnevfbaf cre grez: B(a) gvzr sbe na vachg bs a olgrf, naq ab nyybpngvba rkprcg gur
reebe. `Sbezng` qbrf 6 qvivfvbaf naq jevgrf ng zbfg 6 ahzoref.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul abg n erthyne rkcerffvba?* Vg pna purpx gur funcr, ohg vg pnaabg fnl juvpu olgr vf jebat
  be jul, naq vg pnaabg purpx gur enatr. Gur fpnaare vf abg ybatre guna gur ertrk cyhf gur pbqr
  gung jbhyq rkcynva vgf snvyherf.
- *Jul vf `0` fcrpvny naq abg `00`?* Orpnhfr gur tenzzne fnlf fb, nf Cebzrgurhf qbrf. Nal bgure
  ahzore arrqf n havg, fb n sbetbggra havg (`fvyrapr.fu qvfx 2`) vf na reebe naq abg 2 af.
- *Jul ercbeg gur havg orsber gur biresybj?* Vg zngpurf ubj n crefba svkrf gur vachg, naq gur
  ERNQZR svkrf gur beqre fb gung gur grfgf pna purpx vg.
- *Qbrf `Cnefr` nyybpngr?* Bayl ba reebe. `qvtvgf` naq `f[havgFgneg:v]` ner fhofgevatf gung funer
  gur vachg'f olgrf.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **N synt:** `glcr Qhengvba gvzr.Qhengvba` jvgu `Frg(f fgevat) reebe` gung pnyyf `Cnefr` naq
  `Fgevat() fgevat` gung pnyyf `Sbezng`. Cnff `&q` gb `synt.Ine`. Ba n onq inyhr `synt` cevagf gur
  `*FlagnkReebe` zrffntr naq gur hfntr, naq rkvgf jvgu fgnghf 2.
- **Lrnef:** nqq `{"l", 365 * 24 * gvzr.Ubhe}` ng gur sebag bs `havgf`. Enax, beqre naq `Sbezng`
  sbyybj sebz gur gnoyr. Purpx gur yvzvg ntnva: nobhg 292 lrnef.
- **Grkg znefunyvat:** `HaznefunyGrkg([]olgr) reebe` naq `ZnefunyGrkg() ([]olgr, reebe)` ba gur
  fnzr `Qhengvba` glcr, naq `rapbqvat/wfba` hfrf gurz sbe `"15q"`.
